CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Much Ado About Nothing
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:998684
DTSTAMP:20261016T215145Z
DTSTART:20261101T000000Z
DTEND:20261101T022000Z
SUMMARY:Much Ado About Nothing
LOCATION:Winter Garden Theatre, 1634 Broadway, New York NY 10019
DESCRIPTION:<p>Tom Hiddleston is Benedick.<br />Hayley Atwell is
  Beatrice.<br />10 weeks only.<br /><br />Two of their generation&rsquo;s
  finest actors star in Tony&reg; winner Jamie Lloyd&rsquo;s joy-fueled
  reinvention of <em>Much Ado About Nothing</em>. This giddily funny and
  beautifully tender battle of wits comes to Broadway after a
  record-breaking run in London, where it was named the &ldquo;#1 Best Show
  of the Year&rdquo; (<em>Time Out</em>).</p>
END:VEVENT
